  "detached_impact_map": "../shield-impact-ricochets/shield-impact-ricochets-map.json",
  "implementation_notes": [
    "Force fields use registered back and front atlases so enemies render inside the shell.",
    "Directional deflectors rotate with enemy facing and evaluate only hits inside the forward coverage arc.",
    "Spawn detached impact VFX at the actual collision point and rotate ricochet streaks to the reflected velocity.",
    "Tune energy, arc, and reflection eligibility per enemy without changing the art."
  ]
